      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006006,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 8,
      "SpeakerName": "导演",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "到这里。先停一下表演。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20060060080",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006006009,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006006,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 9,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜、千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "是！",
      "VoiceFileName": "20060060090",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006006010,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006006,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 10,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "导演，怎么了吗？/n刚才的表演有什么问题吗……？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20060060100",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 30103,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006006011,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006006,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 11,
      "SpeakerName": "导演",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不，总体不差。/n不差是没错……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20060060110",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006006012,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006006,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 12,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "但是什么？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20060060120",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006006013,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006006,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 13,
      "SpeakerName": "导演",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……我想让表演更有“大海”的感觉。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20060060130",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006006014,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006006,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 14,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "大海……吗？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20060060140",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 30103,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006006015,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006006,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 15,
      "SpeakerName": "导演",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "对。比如千寿。/n你刚才的表演，是在引导对方去听来自海底的声音吧。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20060060150",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006006016,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006006,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 16,
      "SpeakerName": "导演",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "可这部作品真正需要的，只是让对方意识到那个声音。/n不是试图让他听见，而是暗示那个声音确实存在。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20060060160",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006006017,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006006,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 17,
      "SpeakerName": "导演",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "低语一直夹杂在浪声中从未停歇。/n利用对方对你怀有的感情，让他自己察觉。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20060060170",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006006018,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006006,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 18,
      "SpeakerName": "导演",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "这正是你母亲曾经在舞台上演出的方式。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20060060180",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006006019,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006006,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 19,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "母亲大人……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20060060190",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 500,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30103,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
